    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00513_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(I considered the odds of improvement low, as the preconditions have not changed much...)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00514_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(But if everyone is so motivated... Perhaps this will succeed without needing to resort to the ultimate kari.)",
      "Vietnamese": ""
    },
    {
      "Key": "VC_AC42_00515_VBalakrishnan",
      "Context": "Adv.talkWithFacialInMonolog:3",
      "Original": "(And we should devote ourselves to guarding the experimental farm, too.)",
